{"uuid":"bedee263-27b9-4d73-ab77-6b5c747dff69","variant":"base","mode":"judged","verdict":"pass","notes":"Judged for the new each-player prompt flow (human prompted during the AI's trigger). Desktop and mobile, as=enemy via labStage (human holds two cards, so the choice is not forced): the AI's ▸Materialized resolves, the active AI discards first (its discarded card shown on its void), then the human gets 'Discard a card' naming Wasteland Arbitrator with exactly their two hand cards selectable, 0/1 counter, not cancellable; after submit both discards appear in the log in order. __caps empty.","bead":"hv-umm2.62","commit":"e3aa8d3338c96caafc16265d458ac14c28c50714","screens":["wasteland-enemy-discard-prompt-desktop.png","wasteland-enemy-resolved-desktop.png","wasteland-enemy-log-desktop.png","wasteland-enemy-discard-prompt-mobile.png","wasteland-enemy-resolved-mobile.png","wasteland-enemy-log-mobile.png"]}
